    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that a global reduction in burned area and wildfire emissions since the 1930s, driven by fire suppression linked to population growth, is a significant mechanism that enhances the terrestrial carbon sink, accounting for approximately 19% of the land's total carbon uptake.",
